  focus: "This lesson examines procurement route selection for housing association-led residential development, covering design & build, two-stage tendering, framework agreements, and their implications for risk allocation, programme certainty, and Homes England compliance. Understanding procurement strategy is essential for APC candidates who must demonstrate they can advise on structuring delivery to meet RP board, funder, and grant requirements.",
